    "XOR of everything cancels the pairs. What is left, and why is it not zero?",
    "The total is a ^ b. Any bit set in it is a bit where a and b differ.",
    "Pick the lowest set bit with x & -x, split the values by whether they have that bit, and XOR each group separately: each group holds one lone value plus whole pairs."
